				(size 1 1)
			)
		)
		(uuid "0f6e40e6-1c56-4eda-ae58-d5fcb47d5a87")
	)
	(text "STLINK CONNECTOR\n- T_VCC     MCU VDDIO (3V3)\n- T_SWDIO   SWDIO \n- T_SWCLK   SWCLK\n- T_SWO     SWO\n- T_NRST    MCU NRST\n- GNDDetect MCU GND *No detection\n\nNOTE:\n- GNDDetect Tied to GND by STLINK-V3SET firmware. It might be used by \n  the target to detect the tool. Detection might happen through pull-up \n  on the target board which would be HIGH when STLINK disconnected\n  and would be LOW (pulled LOW by the tie to GND on STLINK).\n  Connect to a general GPIO."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 203.2 53.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "18383506-29c5-48ed-90b5-8a54d9e6b289")
	)
